      "label": "NNNNN (SEPOMEX five-digit postal area)",
      "required": true,
      "usage": "Use only an exact release-pinned SEPOMEX five-digit assignment. The SEPOMEX 2025 state SHP resources are official CC BY 4.0 postal-boundary releases and may support official-source Polygon or MultiPolygon geometry only after all 32 resource records, edition, state scope, attribution, schema, CRS and SHA-256 digests are pinned and topology, gaps, overlaps and duplicate-code parts are validated. The downloadable national catalog supports settlement, municipality, city and state assignment context but is not itself geometry. INEGI geo-statistical entities, localities, settlements, roads, AGEBs and blocks, the geographic-address standard, DENUE establishments, cadastral objects, parcels, community data, buffers, interpolation, Voronoi or models never become SEPOMEX postal geometry. Repaired, generalized, compressed or gap-generated surfaces are derived-review and must preserve their official source lineage and uncertainty. Never infer a street, exterior or interior number, household, person, delivery entitlement or exact building from postcode containment. Building display requires a rights-cleared stable civic-address identifier and an explicit reviewed relation to a permitted building or establishment identifier; DENUE points are business-establishment context and may be approximate or rural locality centroids. AGID remains an independent versioned spatial crosswalk."
    },
